summon item 18 72 29 {Tags:["ff_task_book_temp"],PickupDelay:32767,Age:-32768,Item:{id:"minecraft:written_book",count:1,components:{written_book_content:{title:"ꜱɴɪꜰꜰᴇʀ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ",author:"ғᴏssɪʟ ғʀɪɢʜᴛs",pages:[[{"text":"ꜱɴɪꜰꜰᴇʀ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ\n"},{"text":"-------------------\n"},{"text":"ᴜɴᴋɴᴏᴡɴ ● "},{"text":"ɪɴꜱᴀɴᴇ\n","color":"gold"},{"text":"\nWow. So you really made it 10 days. Most people quit after 2. Well, technically I fire them. Anyway.....\n\n(Multiple Pages)\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"I think I can trust you with this. I left the secret laboratory doors open. It’s between the rings of Earth up on the top floor, in the Ordovician.\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"I’m going to need you to clone a dino for me. I’m out of microfiber cloths; you’ll have to flatten a sponge with the anvil, then use that to scrub the sniffer egg for DNA. \n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"Now put that DNA cloth in the DNA analyzer, it's that machine with the big empty tank. If it works it will start running, and you'll see a dino in the cloning vat.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"Next the check the screen of the Clonomat, it will specify an item it needs. Go grab and toss it into the centrifuge; if the items are correct it will start spinning.\n\n\n\n\n\n"}],[{"text":"And uhm, yeah. That's it... If you get this done I'll hire you full-time. I'll start paying you, even. \n\nOh! I almost forgot, the Clonomat produces a plushie as a byproduct. Feel free to keep it, I've got hundreds already."}]]},custom_name:{"text":"ꜱɴɪꜰꜰᴇʀ ᴄʟᴏɴᴇ","color":"gold","italic":false},lore:[{"text":"","extra":["task_final"]}],enchantment_glint_override:false,tooltip_display:{hidden_components:["lore","written_book_content"]},max_stack_size:99,custom_data:{ff_task_book:"sniffer_clone"}}}}
